    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-βλύζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spirt out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. οἴνου</span>
			<i>spirt out</i> some wine, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.491
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				32
			</span></i>; 
